        "ROB_RAVAGER_BODY_BEAM_UNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_DESC": "Como Ravager, completa una etapa sin llenar el Pozo de sangre.",
        "ROB_RAVAGER_BODY_WALLJUMP_UNLOCKABLE_UNLOCKABLE_NAME": "Ravager: Maximum Monkey",
